# Without this the build context includes node_modules and dist — tens of thousands
# of files that make "load build context" take minutes on a virtiofs-backed Docker
# host. The image installs its own dependencies anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
# Anchored: only the runtime config volume at the repo root. An unanchored "config/"
# would also drop server/src/config, which is source code.
/config/
*.log
